WEBVTT

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:04.690
<i>If I want to acquire a large sum of 
money, I'll have to hunt bandits.</i>

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:11.360
<i>The question is how I'll do it.</i>

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:16.570
<i>Depending on the circumstances, I could 
end up facing multiple bandits at once.</i>

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.290
<i>But this time, I won't be 
attacking a distracted opponent.</i>

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.210
<i>Am I strong enough to do it?</i>

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:26.290
<i>No, I </i>have<i> to.</i>

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:27.710
<i>Job Settings.</i>

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:31.300
<i><b>Equipped Jobs</b></i>

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:31.300
