\h\h\h\hSkill: Rush</b></i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:36.180
<i>It has stronger effects than 
Villager, and it's got a skill.</i>

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:38.640
<i>I'll keep Hero, and...</i>

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:43.640
<i><b>Explorer</b></i>

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:43.640
<i><b>Hero</b></i>

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:43.640
<i><b>Thief</b></i>

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.640
<i>Given what I'm about to do, 
this is the best setup.</i>

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:49.940
<i>Starting tomorrow, I'll be walking.</i>

00:00:56.530 --> 00:01:01.330
<b>in the Labyrinth of Another World</b>

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:01.330
<b>Harem</b>

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:22.700
<b><i>3 Days to
Purchase Roxanne</i></b>

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:31.710
<i>Identify.</i>

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:34.340
<b><i>Priest</i></b>

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:34.340
<b><i>Villager</i></b>

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:34.340
<b><i>Adventurer</i></b>

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:38.840
<b><i>Adventurer</i></b>

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:38.840
<b><i>Villager</i></b>

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:38.840
<b><i>Villager</i></b>

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:38.840
<i>None here.</i>

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:42.180
<i>But having access to Identify 
is a huge advantage.</i>

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:44.640
<i>I can tell at a glance who's a bandit.</i>

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:45.850
The bandits?

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:49.020
Yeah. Word is, they're being 
taken out one after another.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:51.350
Maybe they're getting revenge.

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:54.770
It's probably those guys who were 
chased out of the slums to the north.

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:55.860
<i>The slums?</i>

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:59.740
Mr. Michio, try not to look around too much.

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:03.410
There are some unsafe areas around here.

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:08.000
There are brothels, as well, 
but I wouldn't recommend going inside them.

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:13.460
Teleport.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:16.500
<b><i>The Slums</i></b>

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:20.010
<i>The air here is different.</i>

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:21.510
<i>It smells like sewage.</i>

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:25.430
<i>In addition to being the 
endpoint of the sewer,</i>

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:27.850
<i>it's also where outcasts and wretches end up.</i>

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:29.810
<i>Identify.</i>

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:32.310
<b><i>Villager</i></b>

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:32.310
<b><i>Villager</i></b>

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:32.310
<b><i>Villager</i></b>

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.900
<i>I don't see any bandits.</i>

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:34.860
<i>Are they being cautious?</i>

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:39.360
<i>I suppose bandits wouldn't boldly 
walk around in broad daylight.</i>

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:41.530
<i>This stench alone is going to make me sick.</i>

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:42.780
<i>Teleport.</i>

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:45.580
<i>I'll check it out again at night.</i>

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:57.710
<i>I stopped becoming depressed even 
after repeated uses of Teleport.</i>

00:03:58.050 --> 00:04:01.470
<i>Must be because of the levels 
I gained fighting that battle.</i>

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:04.220
<i>I turned that potential 
disaster into good fortune.</i>

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:08.470
<i>I should be able to handle some 
bandits even if the worst happens.</i>

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:11.600
Time to resume exploring.

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:16.150
Going back into the labyrinth?

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:18.400
Yeah. Hold onto my key for me.

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:19.650
Sure thing.

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:21.400
You're working hard, aren't you?

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:24.280
You don't need a lantern?

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:33.920
<i>I'm glad I borrowed this.</i>

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:37.380
<i>It only illuminates the area right around 
my feet, but it's better than not having it.</i>

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:40.300
<i>This is my first time out 
on the town at night.</i>

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:42.630
<i>Is there anything different at night?</i>

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:43.720
<i>Identify.</i>

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.130
<b><i>Villager</i></b>

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.130
<b><i>Villager</i></b>

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.130
<b><i>Warrior</i></b>

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:47.140
<b><i>Villager</i></b>

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:47.140
<b><i>Villager</i></b>

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:47.140
<b><i>Villager</i></b>

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:50.140
<i>Still no bandits.</i>

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:53.560
<i>I thought they'd be around 
at night. Oh, well.</i>

00:04:58.690 --> 00:04:59.690
<i>What is that?</i>

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:01.900
<b><i>Red Light District</i></b>

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:09.030
<i>This is totally different from the 
red light district during the day.</i>

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:14.370
<i>The lights at night make it 
seem so much more dazzling.</i>

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:22.170
<i>Calm down, calm down.</i>

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:26.550
<i>Think about it.</i>

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:28.890
<i>I could get ripped off.</i>

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:34.430
<i>And I can't imagine there's anyone 
here as beautiful as Roxanne.</i>

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:39.230
<i>Not entering a shop is the right choice.</i>

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:51.030
<i>Identify.</i>

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:52.620
<b><i>Bandit</i></b>

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:55.290
<i>Found one.</i>

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:07.510
<i>He's definitely heading towards the slums.</i>

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:20.860
<i>Are there no other bandits?</i>

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:24.860
<i>Identify.</i>

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:26.280
<b><i>Bandit</i></b>

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.280
<b><i>Bandit</i></b>

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:26.280
<b><i>Bandit</i></b>

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:26.280
<b><i>Bandit</i></b>

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:26.280
<b><i>Bandit</i></b>

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:31.660
<i>If there are lookouts posted outside,</i>

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:34.370
<i>then that single-story house must 
be the bandits' headquarters.</i>

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:35.200
<i>Teleport.</i>

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.210
Yeah, we've got Hugo to thank for that.

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:44.630
<i>Did he just say Hugo?</i>

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:52.390
<i>I think the bandit boss I beheaded 
in the starting town was Hugo.</i>

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.800
<i>Identify</i>

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.800
<i><b>Hugo</b></i>

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.800
<i><b><Male 38 Years Old>
 Thief: Lv 41
 Equipment: Iron Sword
 Thief's Bandanna
 Iron Armor
 Leather Boots</b></i>

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:57.680
<i>Which means he's one of the remaining 
bandits who were chased out of town</i>

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.690
<i>or an associate of Hugo.</i>

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:02.690
<i>I need to do more research.</i>

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.190
<b><i>2 Days to
Purchase Roxanne</i></b>

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:09.200
<i>I see. I'm starting to get a sense 
of what this town's like at night.</i>

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:11.570
<i>Perhaps because people 
typically stay overnight,</i>

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:14.030
<i>the businesses in the red 
light district close early,</i>

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:16.580
<i>starting with shops that attract customers.</i>

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:19.790
<i>Then the bandits come out to play.</i>

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:25.380
<i>Like guards, they either patrol the town 
and stand at crossroads or carouse at bars.</i>

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:30.170
<i>Even the bandits must have 
groups and territories.</i>

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:34.720
<i>And they avoid interacting with 
each other to an unnatural degree.</i>

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:38.930
<i>That guy who was standing in basically 
the same place yesterday is one of them.</i>

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:43.480
<i>It's not much, but this area must be his.</i>

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:46.400
<i>Even if I hunted his group,</i>

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:50.740
<i>the other groups would see it as someone 
else's problem and wouldn't make a fuss.</i>

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:58.080
<i>If individual groups avoid interacting 
with each other, then I can make it work.</i>

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:01.460
<b><i>Vale
Vale Restaurant</i></b>

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:05.330
Welcome back.

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:07.340
You were out late in the labyrinth.

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:10.670
Have something to eat. 
It's on the house.

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:13.470
The murders?

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:15.760
Those murders, huh?

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:19.890
There's a power struggle between the bandits 
who live in the slums of this town.

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:21.980
I heard it was revenge.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:24.980
You know about that?

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:28.440
Between you and me, that's made up.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:29.480
Oh?

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:32.990
A little while ago, there was a change 
in leadership within a certain group.

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:36.700
There was a succession dispute and the 
losing faction was run out of town.

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:40.040
There are bandit factions?

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:41.580
The men who were killed the other day

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:45.420
were bandits who won the succession 
dispute and remained in town,

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:47.840
but they're being targeted 
by other groups, too.

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:50.920
So they're making it look like 
the work of the banished bandits

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:53.670
and using this opportunity to take them down?

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:55.090
Maybe, maybe not.

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:58.760
There might be some trouble 
over in the slums,

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:02.390
but this area is safe, under the 
watchful gaze of the knights.

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:10.730
<i>I avoided entering the bandits' hideout 
without knowing what was going on.</i>

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:15.650
<i>If I end up talking to the bandits, 
then it'll be easier to work something out.</i>

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.040
<i>Roxanne...</i>

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:26.080
<i>Her branches so heavy with enormous fruit...</i>

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:32.380
<i>I'll peel them ever so gently...</i>

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:34.300
<i>And taste them...</i>

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:41.720
<i>They're hard?</i>

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:46.980
Sho harf...

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:53.650
<i>I was so nervous, I didn't get much sleep.</i>

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:56.570
<i>But now's a good time.</i>

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:58.610
<i>I've got my Thief's Bandanna.</i>

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:01.700
<i>I can equip Durandal anytime, too.</i>

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:07.710
<b><i>1 Day to
Purchase Roxanne</i></b>

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:10.330
<b><i>The Slums</i></b>

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:14.000
You got a minute?

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:19.430
Who are you?

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:21.100
No one suspicious.

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:22.680
<i>I'm definitely extremely suspicious.</i>

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:24.470
I want to ask you something.

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:26.890
That's...

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:30.770
Give me the information I want, 
and it's yours for one gold coin.

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:33.860
One, huh? 
What do you want to know about?

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:34.570
<i>He's interested.</i>

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:39.610
<i>So it's true that bandits will 
shell out 10 to 20 thousand nars.</i>

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:40.990
Tell me about Hugo.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:45.830
Apparently, our brother Hugo was killed.

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:49.330
I see. The man's dead, huh?

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:52.080
Could you tell me more about that?

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:55.250
Wait here.

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:56.840
Sure, got it.

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:05.680
<i>His allies must be in that room.</i>

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:07.680
<i>I'll remember that.</i>

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:12.310
Our boss knew Hugo, too.

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:15.730
He's sleeping right now, but you 
should introduce yourself later.

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:16.820
Good idea.

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:18.860
The money's in my room.

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:20.610
Can we talk in there?

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:21.450
Sure.

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:22.110
Come in.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:28.000
This is it. 
I'll give you the money here.

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:39.670
First, could I confirm that's 
really a Thief's Bandanna?

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:41.760
I didn't get a good look at it earlier.

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:42.550
Sure.

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:52.440
There was a succession 
dispute a short while ago.

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:55.900
He was supposed to take over,

00:11:55.900 --> 00:12:00.530
but some other factions joined 
forces and drove him out of town.

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:06.370
They say Hugo attacked some 
village after that and failed.

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:08.540
What an idiot.

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:11.250
There's no point in trying to run.

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:14.580
Nobody saw me bring you here.

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:16.630
I don't know where you got that,

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:20.210
but with a Thief's Bandanna, 
I could get even more done.

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:21.720
Hand it over.

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:24.890
So this was your intention from the start.

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:27.010
Not that I didn't know.

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:27.680
Bah!

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:30.220
You don't have a weapon. 
What do you think you can do?

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:33.890
Well, I'll give you this bandanna.

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:38.520
What are you doing?!

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:10.890
<i>Identify.</i>

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:14.640
<i>Two in the back, two in front.</i>

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:18.610
<i>Identify</i>

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:18.610
<i>Nina</i>

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:18.610
<i><Female 28 Years Old>
Thief: Lv 14</i>

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:18.610
<i>Identify</i>

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:18.610
<i>Evan</i>

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:18.610
<i><Male 36 Years Old>
Thief: Lv 38</i>

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:18.610
<i>Identify</i>

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:18.610
<i>Nora</i>

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:18.610
<i><Female 24 Years Old>
Thief: Lv 11</i>

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:18.610
<i>Identify</i>

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:18.610
<i>Conrad</i>

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:18.610
<i><Male 34 Years Old>
Thief: Lv 35</i>

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:18.610
<i>None of them are exceptionally 
high level. Perfect.</i>

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:22.570
<i>His legs are down here.</i>

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:26.030
<i>Which means his head's up here.</i>

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:30.830
<i>Slowly, so he doesn't wake up.</i>

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.200
<i>Is his neck around here?</i>

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:41.920
<i>Judging by all the blood, 
I must've cut an artery.</i>

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:44.630
<i>He's a level 38 bandit.</i>

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:46.970
<i>I'm sure there's a decent bounty on him.</i>

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:51.810
<i>Who's next?</i>

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:57.020
<i>Even if something unexpected occurs, 
worst case, I can teleport out of here.</i>

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:01.820
<i>Crap! She made a sound.</i>

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:02.820
Who's there?

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:16.330
<i>The last one noticed that.</i>

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:17.160
<i>Identify.</i>

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:21.380
<i>Identify</i>

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:21.380
<i>Conrad</i>

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:21.380
<i><b><Male 34 Years Old>
Thief: Lv 35
Equipment: Copper Sword</b></i>

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:23.960
<i>This puts me at a disadvantage. Teleport.</i>

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:32.140
<i>He'll assume I'm still inside 
the room and call for help.</i>

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:35.220
<i>I need to time my movements with the door's.</i>

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:36.600
<i>I can't afford to screw this up.</i>

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:39.560
<i>One, two...</i>

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:43.270
<i>All right.</i>

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:51.570
<i>His left hand is the one I'm holding.</i>

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:59.160
<i>Did the other bandits notice?</i>

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:01.500
<i>I don't detect any more 
bandits inside the room.</i>

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:05.550
<i>But it'll be difficult to retrieve 
the female bandit's hand now.</i>

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:07.510
<i>Three is the most I can handle.</i>

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:10.590
<i>I can't take on any more risks.</i>

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:12.930
<i>Teleport. To the labyrinth.</i>

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:22.100
All right. I did it.

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:24.820
I finally did the unthinkable.

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:33.870
<i>No, it's probably because I'm low on 
MP from teleporting a bunch of times.</i>

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:35.490
<i>If I can just defeat some monsters...</i>

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:43.710
<i>I should be at max MP by now.</i>

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:49.130
<i>No.</i>

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:55.930
<i>In this world, killing bandits 
shouldn't be a big deal.</i>

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:59.470
<i>This world is different 
from the one I came from.</i>

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:03.480
<i>There are no police, laws, 
or human rights to protect us.</i>

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:09.070
<i>This was my only option.</i>

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:15.240
<i>The bandits won't make a fuss over this.</i>

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:17.780
<i>If word gets out that their 
leaders were killed,</i>

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:20.790
<i>the other bandits might come after them next.</i>

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:25.580
<i>More importantly, how am 
I going to cash these in?</i>

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:28.000
<i>I just recently claimed a bounty.</i>

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:31.880
<i>If I bring more of these in back to back, 
I might attract the attention of the knights.</i>

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:34.430
<i>Should I take their cards to another town?</i>

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:38.390
<i>No, wait. What if they question me?</i>

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:41.680
<i>They might ask me about the circumstances 
under which I killed the bandits.</i>

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:46.400
<i>Wouldn't they find it suspicious that I 
didn't bring them to my own town's knights?</i>

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:48.270
<i>It's no use.</i>

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:51.280
<i>My head's all screwed up.</i>

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:54.200
<i>I don't know what will happen, 
but one thing's for certain.</i>

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:58.620
<i>It's looking more likely 
that I'll acquire Roxanne.</i>

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:01.160
<i>I did everything I could.</i>

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:04.960
<i>I did everything.</i>

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:08.670
<b><i>Last Day to
Purchase Roxanne</i></b>

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:15.840
I slept better than I expected.

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:17.760
Now, then...

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:27.150
<i>I should minimize the number of people 
who recognize me, just in case.</i>

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:30.900
<i>It'd be easier if I knew a knight 
who was familiar with the situation.</i>

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:33.740
<i>It's him.</i>

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:37.410
<i>He was there when I claimed my first bounty.</i>

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:40.080
Hey.

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:42.330
Hello.

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:45.290
Some guys picked a fight with me last night.

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:47.500
Apparently, they were bandits.

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.540
Bandits?

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.920
I fought back and killed them, of course.

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:54.630
How unfortunate.

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:58.010
May I take a look at your Intelligence Card?

00:17:58.010 --> 00:17:58.760
Sure.

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:01.760
Will of the swiftly flowing spirits,

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:03.890
steady breath of wisdom.

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:05.770
Open Intelligence Card.

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:10.440
All good.

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:14.110
I'll go examine these.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:20.660
<i>He didn't ask any questions. Success.</i>

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:23.160
<i>I had the same thought last time,</i>

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:26.910
<i>but I guess that's how bandits 
are regarded in this world.</i>

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:31.920
I was able to confirm they 
belonged to three bandits.

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:34.380
Two of them had bounties on them.

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:36.760
Thank you.

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:39.720
<i>That was easier than I expected.</i>

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:45.560
How many gold coins did I get?

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:47.480
One, two...

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:54.270
<i>There's more than seven in here.</i>

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:58.240
<i>With the 33 gold coins and 228 
silver coins I've already got,</i>

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:00.990
<i>I can buy Roxanne.</i>

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:08.000
I knew you could do it.

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:10.080
Sorry about all the silver coins.

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:11.710
That's not a problem.

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:13.630
I'll be taking these.

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:17.760
I'll bring her to you right away. 
One moment, please.

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:26.640
<i>He's taking a while.</i>

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:30.140
Thank you for waiting.

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:33.860
This is Roxanne, the girl you requested.

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:42.820
Thank you.

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:44.780
Nice to meet you.

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:50.160
Yes, Master. However, 
I must apologize to you for one thing.

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:52.250
<i>What?</i>

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:56.340
<i>Is she going to spring on me now that 
she was working with the slave trader?</i>

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:59.760
<i>Or that she didn't want me to buy her?</i>

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:06.760
I believed you'd come for 
me and waited for you.

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:10.980
But I doubted you once.

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:13.690
I thought you might not come for me.

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:17.980
Please forgive me.

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:22.150
Otherwise I don't deserve 
to be purchased by you.

00:20:24.410 --> 00:20:28.160
<i>As of today, you shall 
be known as Melos-anne.</i>

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:30.200
Raise your head.

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:35.540
It's not a problem. 
Don't worry about it.

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:37.790
Yes, Master.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:40.710
Roxanne, go to the customer.

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:49.890
Let us establish a contract.

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:54.060
May I see your Intelligence Cards?

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:55.150
Yeah.

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:55.150
Yes, sir.

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:57.400
Will of the swiftly flowing spirits,

00:20:57.400 --> 00:20:58.900
steady breath of wisdom.

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:00.980
Open Intelligence Card.

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:03.240
<i>I should've given up on 
Roxanne at least once, too.</i>

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:05.410
<i>Then we'd be even.</i>

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:09.410
<i>Not that I could've given 
up on someone so beautiful.</i>

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:13.410
The contract is sealed.

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:18.000
Please take a look each 
other's Intelligence Cards.

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:19.630
Yes, sir. Here.

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:25.470
<i></i><b>Roxanne <Female 16 Years Old> Beast Warrior – Slave
Owner: Kaga Michio</b>

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:25.470
I see. I can tell we've signed a contract.

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:29.470
<i>Which means the slave trader 
wasn't a con artist.</i>

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:33.230
May I?

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:37.400
There's nothing on here I 
wouldn't want you seeing.

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:40.480
Yes, Master.

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:44.860
<i></i><b>Kaga Michio <Male 17 Years Old> Explorer – Free Man
Owned Slaves: Roxanne</b>

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:42.940
<i>My job is set to Explorer.</i>

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:45.490
<i>So your card displays your first job.</i>

00:21:45.490 --> 00:21:49.490
<b>Kaga Michio <Male 17 Years Old>
Owned Slaves: Roxanne</b>

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:49.490
<i>And this shows that I own her.</i>

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:53.910
Thank you for purchasing one of our slaves.

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:53.910
<i>Finally...</i>

00:21:53.910 --> 00:21:58.580
As of today, you are Roxanne's owner.

00:21:58.580 --> 00:21:59.830
<i>Finally...</i>

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:05.340
<i>Finally, I've acquired Roxanne.</i>

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:10.220
<b>in the Labyrinth of Another World</b>

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:10.220
<b>Harem</b>
